Server faol kompaniya postiga `contact: {phone, telegram, mapUrl}`
qo'shadi (hosting/api/post-contact.js): /api/feed (oddiy, obunalar,
FEATURED — shapeFeedRows), /api/reels, saqlanganlar (postsByKeys) va
/api/companies/:id/posts. Bitta post uchun GET yo'li yo'q.

- Model: PostContact (null-xavfsiz; hammasi bo'sh — null), Post.contact;
  copyWith / copyWithKind saqlaydi. Havolalar profildagi aloqa
  tugmalari qoidasida (ContactInfo.actions): tel: (raqam va +),
  Telegram — @name / t.me / to'liq havola, raqamga o'xshagan qiymat —
  t.me/+raqam; xarita — server havolasi. Faqat tel/http/https.
- Lenta kartasi: izohdan keyin, amallar qatoridan oldin — kichik
  kapsulalar (Capsule dense uslubi, Ivory/Noir tokenlari). Reels:
  muallif ostida, musiqa / NFC ID kapsulalari bilan bir xil qora
  shisha (o'ng ustun to'la, tor ekranda sig'masdi).
- Tor ekran: kapsula eni yozuvga mos nisbatda; hammasi sig'masa — faqat
  belgi (nomi Tooltip va ekran o'quvchida), yozuv kesilmaydi, qator
  toshmaydi. Shaxsiy post, istoriya, kontaktsiz post — qator yo'q;
  ma'lumot post bilan keladi, yuklanishda sakrash yo'q.
- Belgilar profil tugmalaridagi o'sha SVG (contactGlyph). Matn:
  postContactLabel (uz/ru/en), qolgani mavjud contactCall/contactMap.
- Sinovlar: test/post_contact_test.dart — model, ko'rinish/yashirish,
  360/390/430 px ruscha Ivory/Noir, katta shrift, Reels 360 px.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
